<!--
Copy to the target repo root as PROGRESS.md.

Updated at EVERY session end. This is the handoff between sessions and the
thing you read in the morning to know where you are without reading a diff.

Read this and report.md BEFORE the diff. They tell you what the agent BELIEVES
it did; the diff tells you what it did. Where the two diverge is exactly where
the documents were ambiguous, and that divergence is the input to the next
revision of the PRD.

Append, newest last. Do not rewrite history — a session that overstated its
progress is evidence, and editing it away destroys the only record of the
method failing.
-->

